sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Pinned-source trace attribution in the TPC sweep
    accDescr: Successful queries read their trace after ReadyForQuery. SQL errors require a synchronization query. Deadlines and connection failures disable trace capture for the rest of the sweep.
    participant Sweep as TPC sweep
    participant Server as pgwire and pinned binder
    participant Buffer as Trace buffer

    Sweep->>Server: Send one SQL statement
    Note over Server,Buffer: Time each pinned-source bind.<br/>Iceberg, Delta, and NDJSON<br/>Record attempts, failures, and splits.<br/>Include bind time in setup.
    alt Successful SQL statement
        Server->>Buffer: Publish completed trace
        Server-->>Sweep: ReadyForQuery after the rows
        Sweep->>Buffer: Take the trace and attach it to this row
    else SQL error
        Server-->>Sweep: ErrorResponse can arrive first
        Sweep->>Server: Send SELECT 1 on the same connection
        Server->>Buffer: Publish the failed statement's trace for any attempted bind
        Server-->>Sweep: ReadyForQuery for SELECT 1
        Sweep->>Buffer: Take the failed statement's trace if present
    else Deadline, connection loss, or failed synchronization
        Note over Sweep,Buffer: Record trace_error and disable later attachments.<br/>A trace could arrive after the client stops waiting.
    end
